   "text": "Oh, and another thing. I need a new winter coat and I've narrowed it down to a few.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 1.97,
   "block": "shopping.opt1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "So I think I'd go with— actually no, let me list all the options first, then you tell me.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.8,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "describe_options",
   "phrasing": "describe_instruction_v2_25"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "The first one is a long puffy coat that's super warm, but it makes me look like a sleeping bag.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.99,
   "block": "shopping.opt1",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Then there's a wool coat, really stylish, but it's not waterproof at all.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 7.99,
   "block": "shopping.opt1",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "And the last one is a shorter parka with a hood, waterproof and pretty warm, but a bit expensive.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 6.86,
   "block": "shopping.opt1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Finished. Thoughts, Moshi?",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
